{"ex-503-1":{"id":"ex-503-1","chapter":"503","number":1,"title":"鈈的裂變","question":"<p>一個鈈-239（<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Pu</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>）原子核受到中子轟擊後發生裂變，分裂成一個鉬-104（<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Mo</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>）原子核和一個碲-134（<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Te</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>）原子核，並放出 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 個中子。</p><p>(a) 用 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> 表示並寫出反應方程，從而求 <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></math>。</p><p>(b) 如果有足夠的 Pu-239 燃料，此反應能否引發鏈式反應？解釋原因。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Pu</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + <sub>0</sub><sup>1</sup>n → <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Mo</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Te</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> <sub>0</sub><sup>1</sup>n</p><p>考慮質量數。</p><p>239 + 1 = 104 + 134 + <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> × 1</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>x</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 2</p><p>(b) 可以，因為每次裂變會產生多於一個中子，可引發進一步裂變。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_503_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"2dbe2ff78d5ab1dc9ca134172cbdbdc498dac16e9a0772877a03ec40489dc1c5","segments":[{"page":4,"kind":"question","box":[180.6491,439.51689511718746,557.6491,594.8329925537109],"text":"例 題 1 鈈的裂變\r\n鈈-239 ( 239\r\n94Pu) 原子核被一個中子撞擊，發生核裂變，分裂成鉬-104 \r\n( 104\r\n42Mo) 原子核和碲-134 ( 134\r\n52Te) 原子核，並放出 x 個中子。\r\n(a) 以 x 寫出以上反應的方程，並據此找出 x 的值。\r\n(b) 如果有足夠 Pu-239 燃料，這個核反應有可能產生連鎖反應嗎？\r\n試解釋原因。\r\n"},{"page":4,"kind":"answer","box":[180.6491,594.8329925537109,557.6491,743.3698951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 239\r\n94Pu + 1\r\n0n → 104\r\n42Mo + 134\r\n52Te + x1\r\n0n\r\n考慮質量數。\r\n 239 + 1 = 104 + 134 + x × 1\r\n x = 2\r\n(b) 有可能，因為每次裂變都產生多於一個中子，可引發更多裂變。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","question","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-503-2":{"id":"ex-503-2","chapter":"503","number":2,"title":"質能關係","question":"<p>太陽的質量轉化為能量，並每秒釋放 3.85 × 10<sup>26</sup> J。求太陽一個月內所失去的質量。取 1 個月為 2.59 × 10<sup>6</sup> s。</p>","answer":"<p>考慮 1 個月的時間。</p><p>釋放的能量 Δ<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = (3.85 × 10<sup>26</sup>) × (2.59 × 10<sup>6</sup>) = 9.97 × 10<sup>32</sup> J</p><p>由 Δ<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = Δ<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>c</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></math>，</p><p>Δ<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>Δ</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>c</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>(</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>8</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>)</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> = 1.11 × 10<sup>16</sup> kg</p><p>太陽每月損失 1.11 × 10<sup>16</sup> kg 的質量。</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_503_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"2dbe2ff78d5ab1dc9ca134172cbdbdc498dac16e9a0772877a03ec40489dc1c5","segments":[{"page":8,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,418.3608951171875,557.4491,513.6764831542969],"text":"例 題 2 質能關係\r\n太陽的質量轉化為能量，並每秒釋放 3.85 × 1026 J。求太陽一個月內\r\n所失去的質量。取 1 個月為 2.59 × 106\r\n s。\r\n"},{"page":8,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,513.6764831542969,557.4491,694.2138951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n考慮在一個月期間：\r\n釋放的能量 ΔE = (3.85 × 1026) × (2.59 × 106\r\n) = 9.97 × 1032 J\r\n根據 ΔE = Δmc2\r\n，\r\nΔm = ΔE\r\nc\r\n2 = 9.97 × 1032\r\n(3.00 × 108\r\n)\r\n2\r\n = 1.11 × 1016 kg\r\n太陽每個月失去 1.11 × 1016 kg 的質量。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["answer","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-503-3":{"id":"ex-503-3","chapter":"503","number":3,"title":"質量和能量的單位","question":"<p>鈾 -235 原子核的質量為 234.993 422 u。</p><p>(a) 以 kg 為單位表示這質量。</p><p>(b) 據此，求這質量相等於多少能量，答案以 J 表示。</p><p>(c) 求 1 kg 鈾 -235 相等於多少能量，答案以 MeV 為單位。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) 質量 = 234.993 422 × (1.661 × 10<sup>−27</sup>)</p><p>= 3.90 × 10<sup>−25</sup> kg</p><p>(b) 能量 = (3.90 × 10<sup>−25</sup>) × (3.00 × 10<sup>8</sup>)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 3.51 × 10<sup>−8</sup> J</p><p>(c) 能量 = 1 × <span class=\"katex\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mrow><mn>1.661</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>27</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\frac{1}{1.661 \\times  10^{-27}}</annotation></semantics></math></span> × 931</p><p>= 5.61 × 10<sup>29</sup> MeV</p>","tips":"<p>提示：<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mfrac><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>.</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>×</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>−</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>7</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></mrow></mfrac></mrow></math> 所得質量的單位為 u。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_503_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"2dbe2ff78d5ab1dc9ca134172cbdbdc498dac16e9a0772877a03ec40489dc1c5","segments":[{"page":11,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,398.68489511718747,562.4491,544.0010986328125],"text":"例 題 3 質量和能量的單位\r\n鈾-235 原子核的質量為 234.993 422 u。\r\n(a) 以 kg 為單位表示這質量。\r\n(b) 據此，求這質量相等於多少能量，答案以 J 表示。\r\n(c) 求 1 kg 鈾-235 相等於多少能量，答案以 MeV 為單位。\r\n"},{"page":11,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,544.0010986328125,562.4491,744.5378951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) 質量 = 234.993 422 × (1.661 × 10−27) \r\n = 3.90 × 10−25 kg\r\n(b) 能量 = (3.90 × 10−25) × (3.00 × 108\r\n)\r\n2\r\n = 3.51 × 10−8\r\n J\r\n(c) 能量 = 1 ×\r\n1\r\n1.661 × 10–27 × 931 \r\n = 5.61 × 1029 MeV \r\n"},{"page":11,"kind":"tips","box":[40,394.68489511718747,181.4491,744.5378951171875],"text":"提提你\r\n1 × 1\r\n1.661 × 10−27 是以 u\r\n為單位的質量。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"englishAlignedFields":["tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-503-4":{"id":"ex-503-4","chapter":"503","number":4,"title":"核裂變釋放的能量","question":"<p>考慮以下核裂變反應。</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>U</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + <sub>0</sub><sup>1</sup>n → <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>5</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Ba</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>6</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>9</mtext></mrow><mrow><mtext>0</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>Kr</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + 2<sub>0</sub><sup>1</sup>n</p><p>反應前總質量：236.002 087 u。反應後總質量：235.809 305 u。</p><p>(a) 求反應中的質量損失，以 u 表示。</p><p>(b) 從而求反應釋放的能量，以 J 表示。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) Δ<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 236.002 087 − 235.809 305</p><p>= 0.192 782 u</p><p>(b) Δ<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = Δ<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow><msup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>c</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msup></mrow></math> = (0.192 782 × 1.661 × 10<sup>−27</sup>) × (3.00 × 10<sup>8</sup>)<sup>2</sup></p><p>= 2.88 × 10<sup>−11</sup> J</p>","tips":"<p>提示</p><p>應用以下方程前，先把 Δm 的單位由 u 轉換為 kg：</p><p>ΔE = Δmc<sup>2</sup>。</p>","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_503_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"2dbe2ff78d5ab1dc9ca134172cbdbdc498dac16e9a0772877a03ec40489dc1c5","segments":[{"page":13,"kind":"question","box":[185.4491,433.7318951171875,562.4491,611.0478973388672],"text":"例 題 4 核裂變釋放的能量\r\n考慮以下核裂變反應：\r\n235\r\n92U + 1\r\n0n → 144\r\n56Ba + 90\r\n36Kr + 21\r\n0n\r\n236.002 087 u 235.809 305 u\r\n(a) 求反應中損失的質量，答案以 u 為單位。\r\n(b) 據此，求反應釋放的能量，答案以 J 為單位。\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"answer","box":[185.4491,611.0478973388672,562.4491,743.5848951171876],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) Δm = 236.002 087 − 235.809 305 \r\n = 0.192 782 u\r\n(b) ΔE = Δmc2\r\n = (0.192 782 × 1.661 × 10−27) × (3.00 × 108\r\n)\r\n2\r\n = 2.88 × 10−11 J\r\n"},{"page":13,"kind":"tips","box":[40,429.7318951171875,181.4491,743.5848951171876],"text":"提提你\r\n應用 ΔE = Δmc2前，應把\r\nΔm 的單位從 u 轉換為 kg。\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["question","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"},"ex-503-5":{"id":"ex-503-5","chapter":"503","number":5,"title":"核聚變釋放的能量","question":"<p>考慮以下核聚變反應：</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>1</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>3</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>H</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> → <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext> </mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>2</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><mrow><mtext>4</mtext></mrow></mrow></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mtext>He</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> + <sub>0</sub><sup>1</sup>n</p><p>表中列出這些粒子的質量。</p><div class=\"study-table-wrap\"><table><tbody><tr><td><p>粒子</p></td><td><p>質量 / u</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>中子</p></td><td><p>1.008 665</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>氫-2 原子核</p></td><td><p>2.013 553</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>氫-3 原子核</p></td><td><p>3.015 501</p></td></tr><tr><td><p>氦-4 原子核</p></td><td><p>4.001 505</p></td></tr></tbody></table></div><p>(a) 求反應中的質量損失，以 u 表示。</p><p>(b) 從而求反應釋放的能量，以 MeV 表示。</p>","answer":"<p>(a) Δ<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>m</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = (2.013 553 + 3.015 501) − (4.001 505 + 1.008 665) = 0.018 884 u</p><p>(b) Δ<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mrow><mrow><mtext>E</mtext></mrow></mrow></math> = 0.018 884 × 931 = 17.6 MeV</p>","tips":"","think":"","thinkAnswer":"","source":{"file":"DSEPHY_TE_503_TN_ce.pdf","sha256":"2dbe2ff78d5ab1dc9ca134172cbdbdc498dac16e9a0772877a03ec40489dc1c5","segments":[{"page":14,"kind":"question","box":[180.4491,53.499995117187495,557.4491,327.6885681152344],"text":"例 題 5 核聚變釋放的能量\r\n考慮以下核聚變反應：\r\n2\r\n1H + 3\r\n1H → 4\r\n2He + 1\r\n0n\r\n下表列出這些粒子的質量。\r\n粒 子 質量 / u\r\n中 子 1.008 665\r\n氫-2 原子核 2.013 553\r\n氫-3 原子核 3.015 501\r\n氦-4 原子核 4.001 505\r\n(a) 求反應中損失的質量，答案以 u 為單位。\r\n(b) 據此，求反應釋放的能量，答案以 MeV 為單位。\r\n"},{"page":14,"kind":"answer","box":[180.4491,327.6885681152344,557.4491,429.2259951171875],"text":"題 解\r\n(a) Δm = (2.013 553 + 3.015 501) − (4.001 505 + 1.008 665) \r\n= 0.018 884 u\r\n(b) ΔE = 0.018 884 × 931 = 17.6 MeV\r\n"}],"textEdition":"Chinese parallel text; complete English master illustrations and reviewed English-aligned corrections","thinkAnswerEdition":null,"sharedMathematicalAnswer":true,"englishAlignedFields":["question","tips"]},"language":"chn","format":"editable-text"}}